Chapter 3 crit difficulty: faster TARGET, not faster needle

Move the endgame crit challenge from the needle (aimSpeedMult) to the
crit zone (zoneSpeedMult) for all 8 Raid 5 + 6 enemies. The zone base
pace scales with shipSpeed, so slow brutes get a larger mult to reach a
comparable challenge (Breaker 3.0, Bulwark 2.6) while fast evaders stay
modest (Leech/Mirage/Feint 1.6). The needle reverts to normal speed.

